      "transcript_text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: This looks most like an asthma flare-up. The reason I say that is that the way you describe it fits together. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had wheezing for three days, and no leg swelling or fever.",
